{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>TVB小生何廣沛與圈外女友Sarah拍拖近三年，籌備於2026年12月正式步入婚姻殿堂。今日（24日）兩人在社交平台高調大晒遠赴英國倫敦拍攝逾1千張唯美婚紗照，提早為世紀大婚倒數。隨着女方超長頭紗華麗造型曝光，其不為人知富貴公關老闆身分及昔日感情史亦瞬間成為全城焦點。</p>\n<h2>何廣沛攜未婚妻飛赴英國倫敦留影</h2>\n<p>為了籌備即將到來大日子，何廣沛與未婚妻Sarah特意遠赴英國倫敦取景，走訪大笨鐘、西敏寺及聖保羅大教堂等多個著名歷史地標。兩人在莊嚴宏偉大教堂彩繪玻璃窗下深情擁吻，新娘子換上多套名貴婚紗，當中一套微透視白紗搭配數米超長頭紗隨風飄逸，畫面極具復古電影質感。整個拍攝團隊由凌晨直踩到黃昏，最終為這對準新人記錄下超過1千張相片及影片。</p>\n<h2>男方發佈長文高調向未來太太許諾</h2>\n<p>婚紗照正式曝光後，何廣沛同步在個人社交平台發表深情長文，親自為婚禮進入最後階段進行倒數。他特意標註倒數開始標籤，並向未來太太霸氣喊話：「倫敦這個總依戀雨點的地方，遇上了冬天最難得的陽光。愛你是我一生最堅定的選擇，期待迎接我們人生的下一章，餘生、准許我用一輩子繼續寵愛你。」字裡行間流露對女方極致寵溺。</p>\n<h2>公關老闆Sarah短暫婚姻背景曝光</h2>\n<p>二人自2023年開展戀情，Sarah本身家境優渥並曾赴英國留學，現時自立門戶經營著名公關公司做老闆。外界曾傳出女方過去擁有過一段維持約1年短暫婚姻，何廣沛對此大方承認早就知悉未來太太過去，更表明對離婚一事毫不在意。男方坦言拍拖大半年已有成家立室念頭，即將舉行婚宴更有6男10女組成星級兄弟姊妹團助陣。</p>\n<h2>網民湧入留言區祝賀二人白頭到老</h2>\n<p>隨著星級兄弟團陣容與唯美照片公開，大批網民紛紛湧入各大社交平台瘋狂洗版。有網民留言大讚：「男才女貌真係好登對，啲相影到成個童話故事咁！」亦有人聚焦於男方護妻行為：「完全感受到何廣沛有幾錫老婆，好羨慕Sarah搵到個絕世好老公。」更有粉絲對二人在年末舉行婚宴表示期待，直指：「大膽挑戰漸變粉紅西裝好搶眼，真係好期待婚禮當日。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550768409198905_17802990846b0545e537bd4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何廣沛 tvb （圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550768409198905_17802990846b0545e537bd4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550768895957338_13152905336b0545e96b586.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何廣沛 tvb （圖片來源：IG@sarahmiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550768895957338_13152905336b0545e96b586.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sarahmiu）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550769191661738_13984756786b0545ec43bad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何廣沛 tvb （圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550769191661738_13984756786b0545ec43bad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550769633992731_11539629756b0545f0f147b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何廣沛 tvb （圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550769633992731_11539629756b0545f0f147b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550770186174506_20467874376b0545f6320c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何廣沛 tvb （圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550770186174506_20467874376b0545f6320c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550770577188242_8917046916b0545fa8ed9b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何廣沛 tvb （圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550770577188242_8917046916b0545fa8ed9b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>圈外女友Sarah是公關公司創辦人同陳凱琳屬密友</h2>\n<p>據悉，何廣沛新女友Sarah外貌甜美，是一間名為「Talens」的公關公司創辦人，同陳凱琳是密友關係，同時亦是美甲鋪的老板娘。Sarah曾於2021結婚，可惜婚姻只維持了一年多，離婚後就跟何廣沛交往，何廣沛於2023年9月公開與圈外公關美女Sarah的戀情，當時35歲的他透露二人已交往半年，並表示希望盡快步入婚姻。兩人相戀以來鮮少在社交平台公開秀恩愛，但感情穩固。2025年9月何廣沛在Instagram宣布喜訊，成功向Sarah求婚！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/matthew_hkp_1754629201_3694419971557816994_39901440_208294939968958cc4de55f-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何廣沛 tvb 何廣沛在Instagram宣布喜訊，成功向Sarah求婚！（圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/matthew_hkp_1754629201_3694419971557816994_39901440_208294939968958cc4de55f-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>何廣沛在Instagram宣布喜訊，成功向Sarah求婚！（圖片來源：IG@matthew_hkp）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/sarahmiu_1461826294_1238211160831081426_84269_1569213325689591bf931a4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何廣沛 tvb （圖片來源：IG@sarahmiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/sarahmiu_1461826294_1238211160831081426_84269_1569213325689591bf931a4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sarahmiu）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550770991033194_6691394476b0545fe7c7f2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何廣沛 tvb （圖片來源：IG@sarahmiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550770991033194_6691394476b0545fe7c7f2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sarahmiu）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550771321569534_9536191016b054601a2c8a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何廣沛 tvb （圖片來源：IG@sarahmiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179550771321569534_9536191016b054601a2c8a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@sarahmiu）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.414819+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1526,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:08:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:22.131345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:22.131345+00:00","content_hash":"8dc9709492ab7b62c99c7efe3b47a9720dd7aac5b4e5d3085e509f0bf51019d9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}